[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Move the moulding (1a) releasing the inner retainers (1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the sun roof switches.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Sun roof switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428435\">H60</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052957.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052958.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the base with the switches.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052959.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the switch  is undamaged.</p><p>Position the base and secure it using the\nbolts.</p><p>Position the cover and secure it using\nthe bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection and position\nthe moulding attaching the retainers.</p>"]]